meta {
  name: Unfollow a user
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/me/following/{{otherUsername}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Idempotent, like follow. The founder edge created at signup is an ordinary row
  and can be removed here like any other.

  - 204 not following
  - 403 not onboarded
  - 404 no such username
  - 422 unfollowing yourself
  - 429 over the write budget
}
